2026-10-25T02:36:58.1881290Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2734360Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2764610Z [0m
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2768340Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2784590Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2785510Z 
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2786080Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2788390Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2790470Z 
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2791770Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2806360Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2809260Z 
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2809760Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [351..356])[0m and groups [34m(gid 350)[0m
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2810300Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2899310Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2901970Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2902990Z 
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2903270Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2904360Z 
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2904650Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2905890Z    can use Nix.
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2906100Z 
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2906250Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2906480Z 
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2908170Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2909330Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2909780Z 
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2909940Z I will:
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2910170Z 
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2910510Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2911310Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2912200Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2914150Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2914870Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2915410Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2916850Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2917640Z    /var/root
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2918170Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2919080Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2934760Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2938100Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2938600Z  - create a Nix volume and a LaunchDaemon to mount it
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2939080Z  - create a LaunchDaemon (at /Library/LaunchDaemons/org.nixos.nix-daemon.plist) for nix-daemon
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2939520Z 
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2939890Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-10-25T02:36:58.2940180Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
